[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11765.91, "timestamp": "03:16:05", "text": "有些人喜欢这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11769.59, "timestamp": "03:16:09", "text": "剪裁装置。是的。哦好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11772.79, "timestamp": "03:16:12", "text": "想象一下这个场景。 Numei 在她的博客上写道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11775.429, "timestamp": "03:16:15", "text": "直播中，哦，她最近心情很低落"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11778.07, "timestamp": "03:16:18", "text": "最近。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11780.71, "timestamp": "03:16:20", "text": "剪线钳会剪掉那部分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11783.67, "timestamp": "03:16:23", "text": "她说努梅讨厌包，因为她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11786.389, "timestamp": "03:16:26", "text": "最近和包有过接触。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11787.99, "timestamp": "03:16:27", "text": "啊，那种“哦，是的”。是的。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11790.63, "timestamp": "03:16:30", "text": "那种标题党式的假新闻。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11792.229, "timestamp": "03:16:32", "text": "是啊，那很糟糕。坏的。努梅就像，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11794.87, "timestamp": "03:16:34", "text": "“啊，我肚子疼。”努梅是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11801.83, "timestamp": "03:16:41", "text": "我的天啊。哦，我挺喜欢汽水的。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11804.055, "timestamp": "03:16:44", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "LMAO"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11811.269, "timestamp": "03:16:51", "text": "哦。呃，她就像是说：“哦，我喜欢柚子。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11813.95, "timestamp": "03:16:53", "text": "很多。柚子和Nbie有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11817.349, "timestamp": "03:16:57", "text": "性别。 “搞什么鬼？” 就像那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11818.94, "timestamp": "03:16:58", "text": "剪裁。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11819.434, "timestamp": "03:16:59", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "mes